    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/1101.4081v3</id>
    <title>A simple way to speedup Gauss Elimination</title>
    <updated>2013-08-02T02:26:42Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1101.4081v3" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/1101.4081v3" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>This article looks at a simple modification to speedup the conventional Gauss Elimination. The proposed modification speeds up the conventional Gauss Elimination by a factor of nearly 9/7 (in the asymptotic limit).</summary>
